16. Safety Behaviour

The system follows a fail-safe approach.

During a critical fault:

Critical Fault
     ↓
FAULT STATE
     ↓
Motor Torque = 0
     ↓
PWM = 0
     ↓
Fault Indicator = ON

This prevents continued motor operation during critical conditions.

